why can't you get a job well there are  thousands of jobs out there if you're  looking for work you've heard it time  and time again but there are a lot of  people saying despite all the help  wanted ads they are still running into  issues getting a job  joe moeller spoke to some job seekers  who shared their frustrations  while more jobs are popping up around  las vegas some people are still holding  out for those positions  that they know i actually have to wait  for them to call me a barbara brighton  is a joan rivers impersonator  finding a job in the entertainment  capital of the world is still not easy  for her she says as  wonderful as as it is that las vegas has  opened up  it's not completely open for everybody  she says her industry is still slow to  recover and she only has shows booked  for the fall  she continues to receive unemployment  benefits as bookings are hard to come by  it's almost finished we have two more  months thank god for the extension  others are in similar situations while  she knows there are jobs out there  she is holding out for what she knows  how to do i know restaurants still  need a lot of people to come in and work  but i'm not privy to that because  i don't know about that  melissa taylor worked at a coffee shop  at the mccarran airport putting all this  effort  into looking for a job and  there's still i don't get any calls back  finding a job with flexibility for her  family has  not been easy i'm just not getting any  calls back and then  like i said it's just even if i did i  still wouldn't know what i would do with  my kids  with unemployment benefits soon coming  to an end both brighton and taylor say  they will continue to search for  positions  that both will work for them reporting  on the strip joe muller 8 news now  joe thank you the pandemic created a  number of problems for employers and  workers and we are taking a deeper look  at the issues from hiring to  older workers retraining adapting to  remote work and  hot jobs post pandemic those stories  will be at 8 news now  next week
 

